    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals and Code**\n\nI\'m diving into the images and HTML provided. My initial focus is dissecting the visual elements and correlating them with the underlying code structure. I\'m keen on identifying key components and patterns to ensure the app\'s screens accurately reflect the visuals.\n\n\n**Defining App Structure**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the app\'s core pages. The \"Shop\" tab will be a grid layout, complete with filters and product specifics. \"Portfolio\" will showcase case studies, supply highlights, and call-to-actions. Services and About are simple, with direct benefits.\n\n\n**Outlining User Interactions**\n\nNow, I\'m concentrating on the interactive elements. The header search, cart drawer, and product detail modal are starting to take shape in my mind. The shop page filter and sorting mechanisms feel quite clear, as does the \"Get a Quote\" function. Responsive design, including the mobile navigation and floating WhatsApp button, are now a focus.\n\n\n"
