  }
  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the FundiPro Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the initial screens for FundiPro Hardware. The top navigation is taking shape, incorporating the brand logo with the hammer/wrench icon and \"FundiPro Hardware\" (or \"FundiPro\" for mobile) with links to **Shop**, **Portfolio**, **Services**, and **About**. This structure will serve as the foundation for user navigation.\n\n\n**Refining the Top Navigation**\n\nI\'ve been working on the top navigation bar. Key elements I\'ve defined include a search bar with live filtering, a cart button with a badge count, and an account icon linking to a quick modal. For mobile, a hamburger menu will toggle the sidebar navigation. Also, I am thinking of a Top Trust Bar, which will include `KEBS Certified Products`, `KRA Compliant Invoicing`, and `Nationwide Delivery`. I also started designing the Shop page.\n\n\n**Designing Product Filtering**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining the shop page\'s product display. My current focus is on a structured product listing. Each listing will include a dropdown for sorting, along with results count. I\'m building Product Cards. The design will include high-quality images, badges, brand, title, technical specs, price, \"Add to Cart\", and a \"WhatsApp Inquire\" button. The cards will open a modal with product details. Finally, interactive pagination will allow for easy browsing.\n\n\n**Showcasing iPro Hardware\'s Impact**\n\nI\'m now detailing a case study for the Portfolio section, specifically for the Kilimani Luxury Suites project, and will refine this. It will feature images, project descriptions, and a table of technical specs. I have started listing the Supply Highlights, including Industrial Piping, Commercial Electricals, and Structural Steel & Tools. I am also working on CTA options.\nI have begun outlining the Services Page, with headings like Bulk Material Supply & Site Delivery, KRA ETR Invoicing & KEBS Compliance Certification, Dedicated Pro Account Management, and Custom Metal Cutting & Fabrication Services.\n\n\n**Expanding Service Definitions**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Services\" section further. I will include Technical Consultation, and Bill of Quantities (BOQ) estimations. I\'m also working on fleshing out the \"About\" page, detailing FundiPro Hardware\'s history, store locations, and quality guarantees. I\'m designing the \"Contact\" page, with a quick inquiry form, interactive maps, and branch contact details.\nI\'m also working on interactive modals and drawers.\n\n\n**Adding Inquiry Integration**\n\nI\'ve added a floating WhatsApp button to enhance user interaction. This persistent button in the bottom-right corner facilitates quick WhatsApp chats via a direct link. I aim to streamline the inquiry process and improve user convenience.\n\n\n**Cataloging Product Imagery**\n\nI\'m now integrating product images. I\'ve successfully cataloged several key items like the Bosch GBH 2-26 DRE hammer drill, Rhino Mabati Box Profile roofing sheets, and a DeWalt cordless drill, which are now linked to their respective product entries. I am working on consistent image presentation across the catalogue.\n\n\n**Integrating Product Imagery**\n\nI\'ve integrated new product images into the catalog. I\'ve linked visuals for items like a Stanley Wrench Set, Industrial Piping, and another view of the Kilimani Luxury Suites case study.\n\n\n**Organizing File Structure**\n\nI am now focusing on setting up the fundamental file structure. I am updating `metadata.json` with new names and descriptions. I\'ll focus on ensuring that `/index.html` has up-to-date fonts, Google Material symbols, and the proper title.\n\n\n**Defining File Organization**\n\nI\'m now detailing the project\'s directory structure. I\'m actively defining and documenting critical file components, including the custom CSS for styling, data interfaces for product and service types, and rich data catalogues for products and portfolio. Furthermore, I am detailing key component files like the header, trust banner, cart drawer, and various modals for quote requests and product details.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 14
      nanos: 766549131
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
