  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Successful Build**\n\nThe build completed without errors! I\'m now meticulously reviewing the output, paying close attention to the requested \"FundiPro Hardware Visuals & Design.\" My focus is on ensuring every aspect aligns with the prompt\'s intentions. I\'m checking for complete, polished representation of the specifications.\n\n\n**Confirming Branding and Products**\n\nI\'ve verified the visual alignment with the specified branding. The color scheme, typography, and background patterns are all correctly implemented. High-resolution images from the prompt HTML are now embedded for core products. The KEBS/KRA compliance banner and featured industrial deals are verified on the shop screen.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have created the **FundiPro Hardware** web application according to the design and features shown in the screenshots:\n\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**: Built with high-contrast typography (Montserrat display headings paired with Inter body text), warm industrial accent colors (`#914d00` / `#f28c28`), crisp cards, and the signature `dot-pattern` background canvas.\n- **Shop Screen**:\n  - **Trust Banner**: Highlights KEBS Certified products, KRA Compliant invoicing, and nationwide delivery across Kenya.\n  - **Featured Industrial Deals Bento**: Spotlights bulk offers like Bamburi Cement 50kg (Wholesale) and D12 High Tensile Steel.\n  - **Filter Sidebar**: Interactive filtering by Category (*Power Tools, Hand Tools, Building Materials, Roofing Mabati*), Brand (*Bosch, Makita, Bamburi, Rhino Mabati, DeWalt, Stanley*), and price ranges in KSh.\n  - **Product Grid & Technical Specs**: Detailed cards with spec tables (power rating, disc size, sheet gauge, weight), prices in KSh, **Add to Cart**, and instant **WhatsApp Inquiry**.\n- **Portfolio Screen**:\n  - **Hero Header**: *\"Building Kenya\'s Future\"* introduction.\n  - **Featured Case Study**: *Kilimani Luxury Suites* showcase with full project specs (Scope, Scale, Compliance).\n  - **Supply Highlights**: Cards for Industrial Piping, Commercial Electricals, and Structural Steel & Tools.\n  - **Call to Action**: High-impact bulk quote request section.\n- **Interactive Features**:\n  - **Cart Slide-Over**: Interactive cart manager with WhatsApp order generator and **Lipa na M-Pesa** payment simulation.\n  - **Bulk Quote Modal**: Comprehensive BOQ submission form for contractors and developers.\n  - **Product Detail Modal**: Expanded view with full spec sheets and stock status.\n  - **Floating WhatsApp Button**: Persistent direct contact button for quick sales consultation."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 150596842
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1785424546
      nanos: 945277639
