    thinking: "**Verifying Project Completeness**\n\nI\'ve successfully compiled the applet. Now, I\'m meticulously checking views and components for completeness. The `index.html` file includes the Google Fonts loading and body updates are in place. Custom styling rules and variables are configured within `src/index.css`. Currently reviewing the `Header.tsx` and `TrustBanner.tsx` components.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed applying the **Editorial Aesthetic** design theme across all views and interactive modals of the application while preserving 100% of the existing HTML elements, data models, state handlers, and interactive workflows:\n\n- **Global Typography & Palette**: Applied high-contrast serif typography (*Playfair Display*) paired with clean sans-serif body text, warm neutral canvas tones (`#F5F2ED`), subtle dark borders (`border-black/15`), and amber accent highlights (`#b45309`).\n- **Header & Navigation**: Refined with high-contrast editorial top banner, serif logo typography, and clean tracking on active section tabs and cart counter.\n- **Shop & Hardware Catalog**: Redesigned the product grid, filter sidebar, category toggles, pagination, and featured industrial deals with clean borders, micro-badges, and crisp typography.\n- **Case Studies & Portfolio**: Transformed the project showcase, site delivery gallery, and supply highlights into an editorial layout with structured metadata columns.\n- **Services & Corporate Supply**: Updated the site delivery process steps, service cards, and BOQ consultation sections.\n- **Company & Branch Network**: Styled company statistics, core values, and physical branch locations (Nairobi & Mombasa) with minimal borders and serif headlines.\n- **Interactive Modals & Drawers**: \n  - **Shopping Cart Drawer**: Updated item cards, subtotal summary, WhatsApp checkout, and Lipa na M-PESA STK push prompt.\n  - **Product Spec Sheet Modal**: Styled technical specification tables, quantity counters, and direct inquiry actions.\n  - **Industrial Bulk Quote Modal**: Refined form inputs, branch selectors, and confirmation alerts with clean editorial styling.\n  - **Floating WhatsApp Rep**: Redesigned as a sleek dark floating action badge with responsive hover tooltip."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 81489874
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
